3. Symbolicated frames, head 390a3e259 (2026-11-12 09:01)

   255  GrokCLIFetchStrategy.fetch(_:) (GrokProviderDescriptor.swift:193)
    39  closure #1 in CostUsageFetcher.codexScanCatchUpStatus(codexHomePath:calendar:historyDays:now:includeOpenCodeLocalHistory:environment:) (CostUsageFetcher.swift:348)

Reading: on main every refresh cycle runs SpendDashboardController.startLoad -> SpendDashboardSource.load,
whose work lands in CostUsageFetcher.loadLocalTokenScanResult (all-time Codex scan) and
loadCachedCodexTokenActivity (365-day activity). On head none of those frames appear; the only
cost-usage-scan work left in the cycle is the cheap codexScanCatchUpStatus read.
